  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize the 7 of Coins. Try to avoid leaving the table with a sum that allows an easy '15' for the next player.\n\nTable Management: If you can't take a trick, play a card that makes the table total difficult to combine into 15 (e.g., if the table has a 4, don't play an Ace if you know the opponent has a 10/Sota).\n\nCommunication (Partnerships): Use your lead to signal the suit of your 'Flor' or 'Escalera' to your partner without explicitly saying it.",
    Player: "Prioritize the 7 of Coins. Try to avoid leaving the table with a sum that allows an easy '15' for the next player.\n\nTable Management: If you can't take a trick, play a card that makes the table total difficult to combine into 15 (e.g., if the table has a 4, don't play an Ace if you know the opponent has a 10/Sota).\n\nCommunication (Partnerships): Use your lead to signal the suit of your 'Flor' or 'Escalera' to your partner without explicitly saying it.",
